    "body": "The previous dependent H4 reads could not access retained exact content and regressed working responses. This adds a learned geometric selector at the existing word-source/Copy/NoRead boundary, retaining exact references through causal byte copying. Two ordered signed H4 states, learned landmarks and integer cosine-rank lookup execute without matrix products or steady-state allocation. The frozen role-reader supplies construction feature salience and remains the disabled comparator.\n\nThe initial fit exposed interference from inherited word-path/zeta features. A first-source control localized it; the versioned role-context fit keeps those states elsewhere and preserves learned geometric binding.\n\n- Final angular: 320/320 construction source choices, 62/62 earlier responses, 24/24 earlier transfer and 24/24 changed-name cases. Matched exact-code: 152/320, 36/62, 10/24 and 10/24; learned codes disabled: 4/24 fresh.\n- Retains 28/28 longer-context answers/writes and 5/5 persistent-session turns with restore/isolation. Actual CLI-generated Rust copies a fresh identifier, compiles and passes three semantic inputs without repair.\n- Whole-response speedup is not established. Two-link ownership and two-operation arithmetic still return Unknown. Populations are OPEN; sealed evaluation is NOT_RUN.\n\nRetain artifact 55e602a0 for dependent-source development, preserving comparator 067adbf0. Related #1139; its full handoff remains unmet and #1140 stays subsequent. Current state, roadmap, research and evidence record the next exact-entity-to-relation read.\n\nValidation: release CLI/examples, final allocation/kernel source checks, formatting, Rust architecture policy and claim wording pass locally. Initial two focused units passed; revised units run in protected native CI. Complete artifact/parent replay and model/CLI/session execution pass at the documented scope. Normal required compatibility statuses are not broad audit/fuzz/WASM/Gate C tests.\n\nModel commands: 67.516 seconds this cycle; cumulative 1514.012/1800 seconds. Engineering through final local checks: 1162.737/1200 seconds. No storage increase, deletion or paid compute. All earlier artifacts and the original dirty checkout are preserved.\n\nProtected native CI passed at 0a9cec92: 126 model, 3 context, 9 allocation and 20 CLI tests; zero failures or ignored tests. [Run 34040177790](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/actions/runs/34040177790). [PR #1149](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/pull/1149) is first in the protected merge queue, awaiting integration checks. The repository evidence freezes pre-CI measurements; this PR records the completed CI result.\n",
